{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Like Unique Paths, but some cells hold an **obstacle** (`1` in `obstacleGrid`) that the robot can't enter. Count the paths from the top-left to the bottom-right moving only right or down."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/d58d6563-5e88-4ef4-88ab-0424b770bbee.svg",
      "alt": "A 3 by 3 grid with an obstacle in the middle. The obstacle cell has 0 paths. The bottom-right corner adds the cell above it and the cell to its left, 1 + 1 = 2: one path around the top right, one around the bottom left.",
